 on the main network/power supply line.\n*   **Focus:** Ensuring core operational integrity remains even if primary power fails.\n\nPlease confirm if you want me to move forward with the **\"Analog Whiteboard/Paper-based workflow\"** first, or if the focus should remain purely on **\"Self-Sustaining/No-Power\"** hardware.**"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["current_input_echo"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s0"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"current_input_echo","monitor_id":"candidate:e-2358fb0f511f3881ff80eea5","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s0"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1"]},"evidence":{"end":460,"quote":"**Action Plan:**\n\n*   **Priority 1:** Design a dedicated, low-power, mechanical timer/clock system for critical functions (like the irrigation schedule) that requires no external power grid dependence.\n*   **Priority 2:** Implement redundant, independent backup components (like the 'spare' Raspberry Pi units/batteries mentioned) that don't rely on the main network/power supply line.","source_slot":"s1","start":75},"expression_status":"affirmed","monitor_id":"candidate:e-2358fb0f511f3881ff80eea5","relation_support":"supported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":[],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-af0cfa14d234ba3b1733117c","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"non_present_or_unknown_semantic_result","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":"The proposition 'c-a5a01b1ec56bf7d9e0284ec5 caused_by c-d39184618b423a14b37488b4' is not addressed in the available sources.","source_slots":["s0","s1"]},"evidence":null,"expression_status":"not_expressed","mo